    "body": "I think the usual methods of turning off console logs in production are typically done at a [level above this specification](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/1215392), and that seems pretty reasonable to me. There have been somewhat-related proposals like https://github.com/whatwg/console/issues/175, but there didn't seem to be too much appetite for this.\r\n\r\nGiven that, I'm tempted to close this unless implementers want to weigh in /cc @nchevobbe @JosephPecoraro.",
